<h2>1. Executive Summary & Deliverables Breakdown (Simple & Detailed)</h2>
<ul class="highlight-list">
  <li><strong>Total Pages Built & Indexed (158 Pages Total):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>8 Core Business Pages:</strong> Home, About Us, Services Overview, Projects Showcase, Interactive Gallery, Technical Blog Hub, Contact Us, and Custom 404 Error Page.</li>
      <li><strong>120 Programmatic Local SEO Landing Pages:</strong> Covers 6 major commercial hubs in Chennai (Guindy, Saidapet, West Mambalam, Ashok Pillar, Jafferkhanpet, Chennai City) across 20 high-demand power services (6 localities × 20 services = 120 dedicated geo-targeted pages).</li>
      <li><strong>20 Dedicated Service & Product Catalog Pages:</strong> Detailed specification pages for Online UPS (1KVA to 1000KVA), Inverter Batteries, Servo Stabilizers, Isolation Transformers, UPS AMC, and Solar Installations.</li>
      <li><strong>10 Commercial Projects & Technical Guides:</strong> Case studies and published troubleshooting guides driving organic traffic.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Target Search Keywords (66 Strategically Researched Keywords):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Brand Keywords (5 keywords):</strong> "Royal Power Solutions", "Royal Power UPS Chennai", etc.</li>
      <li><strong>High-Priority Commercial Money Keywords (18 keywords):</strong> High-intent search terms like "Online UPS sales Chennai", "UPS battery replacement Chennai", "UPS repair service near me".</li>
      <li><strong>Local Area Geo-Targeted Keywords (21 keywords):</strong> Pinpoint rankings for Guindy, Saidapet, Ashok Pillar, West Mambalam, and Jafferkhanpet.</li>
      <li><strong>Industrial & B2B Keywords (14 keywords):</strong> Three-phase UPS AMC, isolation transformer installation, industrial stabilizer rentals.</li>
      <li><strong>Informational & Blog Keywords (8 keywords):</strong> Common customer queries, error codes, and maintenance guides.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Brand Identity & Logo Design (Included):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Custom professional vector logo design tailored for Royal Power Solutions.</li>
      <li>Delivery in all essential formats: Vector (SVG), High-Resolution Transparent PNG, Print-Ready PDF/JPG.</li>
      <li>Website Favicon, brand color palette codes (Hex/RGB), and typography guidelines.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Google Business Profile (GMB / GBP) Creation & Local Optimization (Included):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Official Google Business Profile creation, setup, and verification guidance.</li>
      <li>Accurate Name, Address, Phone (NAP) sync with Google Maps coordinates.</li>
      <li>Categories selection (UPS Supplier, Electrical Repair, Battery Store), business hours, service areas setup.</li>
      <li>Geotagged product & work photos upload, complete service list, and 1-click Google Review direct link for customers.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Cloud Hosting & 1-Year Technical Maintenance AMC (Included):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>High-speed cloud server deployment with custom domain mapping and DNS setup.</li>
      <li>Lifetime HTTPS / SSL encryption certificate installed for high security and Google trust.</li>
      <li><strong>1 Full Year Technical Maintenance:</strong> Monthly automated cloud backups, 99.9% uptime monitoring, software/script updates, security monitoring, bug fixing, and minor content updates for 12 months.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Lead Generation & Direct Customer Contact (Included):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>1-click floating WhatsApp chat trigger on every single page.</li>
      <li>Click-to-call emergency direct phone dialers for immediate customer hotline calls.</li>
      <li>Interactive quotation inquiry forms with instant notification backend.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

